# Generated artifacts.
#
# GitHub collapses a `linguist-generated` file's diff by default and leaves it out of the language
# statistics, which is what these need: `data/lessons.json` is 1.26 MB rewritten in full by
# `scripts/update_lessons_json.py` on every corpus change, and `docs/lessons/**` is 419 generated pages.
# A reviewer who wants to see the bytes can expand the file; a reviewer who does not was previously
# scrolling past them to find the one hand-written line in the diff.
#
# The rule for this list: the file has a generator named in `data/README.md` (data/) or in
# `docs/.generated-pages.json` (docs/), and a gate that re-runs that generator. Nothing here is written
# by hand, so nothing here is a review target — `tests/test_generated_artifact_marking.py` checks that
# every path exists and that the three artifacts the repository's own docs call generated are listed.
#
# NOTE: `data/counter.json` is deliberately absent even though older documentation called it generated —
# it was deleted on 2026-09-28 along with its mirror workflow (#1820), and a stale path in this file
# would be a rule about nothing.

# ── data/ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
data/lessons.json linguist-generated=true
data/domains.json linguist-generated=true
data/intake-kind-hints.json linguist-generated=true
data/contributor-points.json linguist-generated=true
data/pr-genius-stats.json linguist-generated=true
data/okf/lessons.jsonl linguist-generated=true

# ── docs/ (the site is served verbatim from this tree) ───────────────────────────────────────────
docs/lessons/** linguist-generated=true
docs/topics/** linguist-generated=true
docs/sitemap.xml linguist-generated=true
docs/.generated-pages.json linguist-generated=true
docs/data/** linguist-generated=true
docs/_lessons_count.txt linguist-generated=true

# ── the mirror of the above on the `data` branch is not in this tree ─────────────────────────────
# `badges/*.json` and the compact `lessons.json` live on `data`, written by `update-badges.yml`; a
# `.gitattributes` entry here would describe a file this checkout does not have.
